 **Parameters:**
-*   `screenlist`: List of attribute names (e.g., `['_omega']`, `['_rotation']`) [S1, unofficial].
-*   `variant`: String determining mask handling ('freezweightsbymask' or 'freezweightsbymasknounsqueeze') [S1, unofficial].
